# Scouter Redesign – Wyscout for Gaming

Redesign the scouter experience to be the "Wyscout of esports": a professional scouting tool where scouts can discover players, review match history & highlights, manage a watchlist/favorites, and write reports.

---

## New Navigation Structure (5 tabs)

| Tab | Icon | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Feed** | `rss_feed` | Activity stream: trending players, recent match results, highlights |
| **Explore** | `search` | Browse & filter players by game/rank/region, search by nickname |
| **Matches** | `sports_esports` | Browse scheduled, live & completed matches with scores |
| **Watchlist** | `bookmark` | Saved players by status: WATCHLIST / PROSPECT / ELITE / SIGNED |
| **Reports** | `assignment` | All scouting reports you've written |

---

