### Tab 1 – Feed (replaces Dashboard)

#### [MODIFY] [scouter_dashboard_tab.dart → scouter_feed_tab.dart](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/arena_chain_flutter/lib/screens/scouter/ui/scouter_dashboard_tab.dart)
Rename + completely rewrite as an **activity feed**:
- **Header**: scout avatar + "Scout Feed" + notification bell
- **Trending Players card**: horizontal scroll of top-ranked players with game badge, ELO, tier chip → tap → player detail
- **Recent Matches section**: vertical list of recent completed matches with score, game logo, team names
- **For You**: players you've scouted before with updated stats
- Pull-to-refresh

---

### Tab 2 – Explore / Players

#### [MODIFY] [scouter_players_tab.dart](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/arena_chain_flutter/lib/screens/scouter/ui/scouter_players_tab.dart)
Major redesign:
- **Search bar** at top (search by nickname)
- **Game filter chips** (horizontal scroll – same as today)
- **View toggle**: Leaderboard 🏆 | Cards 🃏
- **Leaderboard view**: rank badge, avatar initial, nickname, team, ELO, tier — same as today but visual polish
- **Cards view**: larger player card with avatar, nickname, game, ELO, region, PRO badge, watchlist heart icon
- Filter FAB → same bottom sheet (tier/country/hasTeam/prospectLevel/priority)

