### Player Detail Screen – Full Wyscout-Style Redesign

#### [MODIFY] [scouter_player_detail_screen.dart](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/arena_chain_flutter/lib/screens/scouter/ui/scouter_player_detail_screen.dart)

**Header (SliverAppBar):**
- Avatar (large), nickname, team badge + name, game
- ELO bar, Tier chip, Region flag emoji, PRO badge
- **Watchlist heart button** (top-right): tap to cycle WATCHLIST → PROSPECT → ELITE → SIGNED → remove
- Share icon

**Action row (below header):**
- `+ Report` | `📋 Recommend` | `✓ Evaluated`

**Tabs (4):**

| Tab | Content |
|---|---|
| **Info** | Stats grid (ELO, Rank, Region, Team, isPro), bio section, physical/account info |
| **Matches** | Recent match history: score, date, status, win/loss color bar — tap for match detail |
| **Highlights** | Placeholder cards for match clips/videos (links to external VODs/replays) |
| **Reports** | Reports written about this player, with rating circles |

