## Verification Plan

### Automated
```bash
flutter analyze --no-pub
```

### Manual
1. Log in as scouter → lands on **Feed** tab
2. Feed shows trending players and recent matches (or graceful empty state)
3. Explore tab → game chip → leaderboard loads → tap player → detail opens
4. Player detail: all 4 tabs scroll correctly, watchlist button cycles levels
5. Matches tab → LIVE/TODAY/UPCOMING/RESULTS sub-filter works
6. Watchlist tab → filtered by prospect level
7. Reports tab → swipe to delete, search bar filters
8. Create Report from player detail → submits and shows success snackbar
